  "description": "Tharwah Gold is an elegant and radiant fragrance that blends fresh fruits, soft florals, and creamy musky warmth into a refined feminine scent. The fragrance feels luxurious, smooth, and versatile with a clean modern character balanced by subtle sweetness. The opening introduces lavender and bergamot, creating a fresh aromatic brightness with a soft citrus touch that feels uplifting and elegant. The heart develops into orange blossom and Egyptian jasmine, adding a creamy floral richness with graceful feminine depth. The base settles into vanilla, amber, and vetiver, leaving a warm, smooth, and long-lasting trail that feels clean, sophisticated, and comforting. Tharwah Gold is perfect for women who enjoy floral musk fragrances with soft sweetness and an elegant modern dry-down.",
